	// Errors: ERROR_REASON_TAYFA_NOT_FOUND, ERROR_REASON_PERMISSION_DENIED,
	// ERROR_REASON_INVITE_NOT_FOUND (unknown ID, another tayfa's link, or
	// another member's link the caller may not revoke).
	RevokeInviteLink(context.Context, *RevokeInviteLinkRequest) (*RevokeInviteLinkResponse, error)
